baylee — an unofficial, non-commercial fan project
====================================================

baylee is unofficial fan content permitted under Wizards of the Coast's Fan
Content Policy. It is not approved, endorsed, sponsored, or affiliated with
Wizards of the Coast. Portions of the materials used (card names, rules text,
and imagery when displayed by clients) are property of Wizards of the Coast,
© Wizards of the Coast LLC. No Wizards of the Coast assets are distributed
in this repository.

Card data and images are provided by Scryfall (https://scryfall.com) under
its API terms. This project honors Scryfall's rate limits and caches images
as encouraged by their guidelines.

The card-script reference this project's code generation may read during
development is the card script corpus of the Forge rules engine
(https://github.com/Card-Forge/forge, GPL-3.0). It is read from a local
checkout the developer supplies, as an automated lookup only: no source code
and no data file of it is copied into this repository, vendored, or
distributed with it, and none of it is present in any build output. Nothing
in this repository is a derived work of it. This paragraph is the only place
that names it; the code and the rest of the documentation call it "the
corpus", and that is a naming choice, not a claim about provenance.

Bundled fonts (crates/baylee-client/assets/fonts/): Alegreya Sans by Juan
Pablo del Peral / Huerta Tipografica (Regular, Medium, Bold, Italic, Medium
Italic), which sets the interface, and Faustina by Omnibus-Type (upright and
italic,
variable weight), which sets card names and rules text — both licensed under
the SIL Open Font License 1.1, whose text is in assets/fonts/licenses/;
Font Awesome Free 6.7.2 (https://fontawesome.com), icons licensed under
CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/); and the Mana font
(https://github.com/andrewgioia/mana) by Andrew Gioia, licensed under the SIL
Open Font License 1.1, whose glyphs the client uses to draw mana symbols.
None of them is a Wizards of the Coast asset.

